{"id":"704d80918bdc79e2","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-thm-dense-set-lemma.md","title":"Dense Set Lemma","display":"thm-dense-set-lemma — Dense Set Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-dense-set-lemma","aliases":["58-thm-dense-set-lemma","Dense Set Lemma","Generic Filter Existence"],"display":"thm-dense-set-lemma — Dense Set Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-dense.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-dense-set-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-dense-set-lemma</span><span>Dense Set Lemma</span><span>Generic Filter Existence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dense-set-lemma — Dense Set Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"681e6314e26cdd0b\" href=\"?note=681e6314e26cdd0b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-dense.md\">../batch10/58-df-dense.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是传递的 ZFC-minus 模型</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,\\le_P)\\in M\">\\((P,\\le_P)\\in M\\)</span> 是强迫偏序，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq P\">\\(D\\subseteq P\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq P\">\\(G\\subseteq P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\le_P,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\le_P,M)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>-泛型滤子谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\le_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\le_P)\\)</span>（相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_P\">\\(\\le_P\\)</span> 的稠密谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"681e6314e26cdd0b\" href=\"?note=681e6314e26cdd0b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-dense.md\">../batch10/58-df-dense.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dense\\text{-}set\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash \\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\le_P,M)\\land D\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\le_P)\\to G\\cap D\\ne\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dense\\text{-}set\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash \\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\le_P,M)\\land D\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\le_P)\\to G\\cap D\\ne\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“泛型”只保证遇到模型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 内部的稠密集，因此条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in M\">\\(D\\in M\\)</span> 不能省略。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 在外部是可数的，Rasiowa–Sikorski 构造在环境宇宙中产生一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>-泛型滤子；该滤子通常不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-generic.md","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-dense.md","status":"r